  "rows": [
    {
      "text": "Article III - Behavior in Libraries",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.021485481411218643,
        "width": 0.266491691271464,
        "x": 0.3153507654361696,
        "y": 0.20128764431434176
      },
      "level": 0.21197453656415646
    },
    {
      "text": "Rules and regulations governing the use of the library shall be",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.030163347721099854,
        "width": 0.4721736510594685,
        "x": 0.21629919326364785,
        "y": 0.21729593871689146
      },
      "level": 0.23304994400188103
    },
    {
      "text": "followed. The following rules and regulations govern the use of the",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.03497525490820408,
        "width": 0.5092430909474691,
        "x": 0.18113183926427615,
        "y": 0.22858575045997287
      },
      "level": 0.24659192237472172
    },
    {
      "text": "College library:",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.020326703786849976,
        "width": 0.11662338177363077,
        "x": 0.1791405956743594,
        "y": 0.2585217203688134
      },
      "level": 0.2646532766602059
    },
    {
      "text": "1. Silence must be observed at all times.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.022189373150467873,
        "width": 0.30523095528284716,
        "x": 0.21317829552854015,
        "y": 0.269218930534175
      },
      "level": 0.2783691536100424
    },
    {
      "text": "2. The main library is an \"open stack\" library. Thus, the",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.026091355830430984,
        "width": 0.4465972582499186,
        "x": 0.2131782946256929,
        "y": 0.28616237680667367
      },
      "level": 0.2965504590061327
    },
    {
      "text": "students may gain access to the library books anytime and",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.024296650663018227,
        "width": 0.4467252095540365,
        "x": 0.24949144622025665,
        "y": 0.30146483439480665
      },
      "level": 0.3134293734360188
    },
    {
      "text": "properly return them to the shelves or the circulation desk.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.025616252794861794,
        "width": 0.45245297749837243,
        "x": 0.2474660899710416,
        "y": 0.3162439763437983
      },
      "level": 0.32738964625014194
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid hiding books so that others may also gain access.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.025299744680523872,
        "width": 0.43110692501068115,
        "x": 0.2475645325341338,
        "y": 0.3310159588248678
      },
      "level": 0.34197742631304445
    },
    {
      "text": "3. Readers must show their ID card at the desk and library",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.022952931001782417,
        "width": 0.44842569033304847,
        "x": 0.2112403100952429,
        "y": 0.3512409436328674
      },
      "level": 0.3621685030483354
    },
    {
      "text": "cards upon borrowing and at the request of the librarian.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.023810576647520065,
        "width": 0.45420149962107337,
        "x": 0.24953140874168542,
        "y": 0.3655980247898367
      },
      "level": 0.37574303219433786
    },
    {
      "text": "Visiting researchers should have identification papers and",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.023556724190711975,
        "width": 0.4562046925226848,
        "x": 0.24765556517588397,
        "y": 0.3815595546549354
      },
      "level": 0.39097560679192184
    },
    {
      "text": "must register with the office of the Chief Librarian.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02318638190627098,
        "width": 0.3863839705785116,
        "x": 0.24762447373667898,
        "y": 0.3967526742886296
      },
      "level": 0.40540925063964156
    },
    {
      "text": "4. For those with circulation privileges, a book is allowed out",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02624413277953863,
        "width": 0.4583475192387899,
        "x": 0.20930232605179597,
        "y": 0.41636174451035446
      },
      "level": 0.4282724744261996
    },
    {
      "text": "for one week. Renewal may be granted if the book is not in",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.024848828092217445,
        "width": 0.4583216905593872,
        "x": 0.2475673611291279,
        "y": 0.4318956225370185
      },
      "level": 0.44255723721498663
    },
    {
      "text": "demand.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.01675037294626236,
        "width": 0.07586164772510529,
        "x": 0.24792188861687514,
        "y": 0.4545608602454294
      },
      "level": 0.456797621393936
    },
    {
      "text": "5. Reserve books, Open Reserves - Books used as",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.01764625683426857,
        "width": 0.30426355202992755,
        "x": 0.25193799649795595,
        "y": 0.47363281224122555
      },
      "level": 0.47519471279116526
    },
    {
      "text": "accompanying reading for course work have unlimited use",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02880651969462633,
        "width": 0.4623166720072429,
        "x": 0.24751425673622554,
        "y": 0.48177895374951607
      },
      "level": 0.4967511928191356
    },
    {
      "text": "in the reading room. This collection is located in open",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02542068250477314,
        "width": 0.4659783442815145,
        "x": 0.24757451752070736,
        "y": 0.4987830355251903
      },
      "level": 0.5095567921537566
    },
    {
      "text": "shelves in the Reserved Section and may be there without",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.023948416113853455,
        "width": 0.4679577350616455,
        "x": 0.24759377241597447,
        "y": 0.5143705497883695
      },
      "level": 0.5238049195583966
    },
    {
      "text": "being signed out.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.017634901218116283,
        "width": 0.13953488071759543,
        "x": 0.24806201654042712,
        "y": 0.5375976565976879
      },
      "level": 0.5390740575884969
    },
    {
      "text": "Close-Reserves - Books in demand prescribed for",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.027439147233963013,
        "width": 0.47005418936411547,
        "x": 0.24941041449630866,
        "y": 0.542925016364985
      },
      "level": 0.5547852246695942
    },
    {
      "text": "courses are charged out at the loan desk and limited from",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.0261150561273098,
        "width": 0.47000229358673096,
        "x": 0.2475176367871524,
        "y": 0.5600666296552081
      },
      "level": 0.5718850864410657
    },
    {
      "text": "one to two hours and overnight use. Books borrowed",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.027135564014315605,
        "width": 0.4721027215321859,
        "x": 0.24746493112741152,
        "y": 0.5748289686042479
      },
      "level": 0.5870884777739025
    },
    {
      "text": "overnight may be checked out at 6:00 P.M. and should be",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.03039322793483734,
        "width": 0.4741374651590984,
        "x": 0.24738713746676458,
        "y": 0.5894266859123527
      },
      "level": 0.605086411701184
    },
    {
      "text": "returned at 9:00 the following morning.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.022829324938356876,
        "width": 0.31869987646738696,
        "x": 0.24560768260997015,
        "y": 0.611272831678646
      },
      "level": 0.6189737605485758
    },
    {
      "text": "Article IV Behavior in Corridors",
      "box": {
